Package: noisedeck-sync
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Noisefactor LLC <support@noisefactor.io>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: libssl3t64, libuv1t64, v4l2loopback-dkms, v4l2loopback-utils
Suggests: avahi-daemon, pipewire, wireplumber
Description: Noisedeck browser-to-video bridge daemon
 Sync receives authenticated browser frames and publishes them to native
 video ecosystems, including a v4l2loopback virtual camera on Linux.
